{"head":{"counts":{"billCount":1,"resultCount":1}},"results":[{"bill":{"act":{"actNo":"34","actYear":"2024","dateSigned":"2024-10-17","longTitleEn":"<p>An Act to consolidate and revise the law relating to planning and development; to provide for proper planning and sustainable development in the interests of the common good; to provide for the licensing of events and control of funfairs; for those purposes to repeal and replace the Planning and Development Act 2000; to amend certain other enactments; and to provide for matters connected therewith.<\/p>\n","longTitleGa":"<p>Acht do chomhdhl\u00fath\u00fa agus d'athmheas an dl\u00ed a bhaineann le plean\u00e1il agus forbairt; do dh\u00e9anamh socr\u00fa maidir le plean\u00e1il chu\u00ed agus forbairt inchothaithe ar mhaithe le leas an phobail; do dh\u00e9anamh socr\u00fa maidir le h\u00f3c\u00e1id\u00ed a chead\u00fan\u00fa agus maidir le haonta\u00ed s\u00fagraidh a rial\u00fa; chun na gcr\u00edoch sin, d\u2019aisghairm agus d\u2019ionad\u00fa an Achta um Plean\u00e1il agus Forbairt, 2000; do leas\u00fa achtach\u00e1in \u00e1irithe eile; agus do dh\u00e9anamh socr\u00fa i dtaobh nithe a bhaineann leis an m\u00e9id sin.<\/p>\n","shortTitleEn":"Planning and Development Act 2024","shortTitleGa":"An tAcht um Plean\u00e1il agus Forbairt, 2024","statutebookURI":"http:\/\/www.irishstatutebook.ie\/eli\/2024\/act\/34","uri":"https:\/\/data.oireachtas.ie\/ie\/oireachtas\/act\/2024\/34"},"amendmentLists":[{"amendmentList":{"amendmentTypeUri":{"uri":"https:\/\/data.oireachtas.ie\/ie\/oireachtas\/def\/amendment-type\/numberedList"},"chamber":{"showAs":"Seanad","uri":"https:\/\/data.oireachtas.ie\/ie\/oireachtas\/def\/seanad"},"date":"2024-10-08","formats":{"pdf":{"uri":"https:\/\/data.oireachtas.ie\/ie\/oireachtas\/bill\/2023\/81\/seanad\/6\/amendment\/numberedList\/eng\/b81b23d-cl-1st-sub-list-of-amendments.pdf"},"xml":null},"showAs":"1st Substitute List of Amendments [D\u00e1il]","stage":{"showAs":"Cream List","uri":"https:\/\/